<section class="grid md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] gap-14 md:gap-18 px-6 md:px-12 py-14 md:py-20 items-center">
  <div class="max-w-[640px]">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 text-[11px] tracking-[0.32em] text-accent font-bold mb-10">
      <span class="inline-block w-9 h-px bg-accent"></span>
      CONCRETE POLISHING STUDIO · SINCE 2026
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-[48px] md:text-[88px] font-black leading-[1] tracking-[-0.045em] mb-9 text-text">
      콘크리트의<br />
      새로운 <span class="text-accent italic font-extrabold">기준.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg text-muted leading-[1.7] mb-14 max-w-[480px]">
      1일 완공. 원하는 색상, 원하는 규사.<br />
      시공이 아닌 작품으로 마감합니다.
    </p>

    <div class="flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
      <a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-text text-bg hover:bg-accent hover:-translate-y-0.5 px-7 py-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.05em] transition-all duration-200">
        무료 견적 받기 →
      </a>
      <a href="#process" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-text border border-border-strong hover:border-text px-7 py-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.05em] transition-colors">
        시공 과정 보기
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden border border-border-strong"
       style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%, rgba(255,248,232,0.85), transparent 55%), linear-gradient(135deg, #C8B594 0%, #B3A07F 50%, #BDAB8B 100%);">
    <span class="absolute top-6 left-6 text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] text-text/70 font-semibold z-10">/ FEATURED WORK</span>
    <span class="absolute top-6 right-6 text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] text-text/70 font-semibold z-10">No. 001</span>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-[1]">
      <div class="text-center px-8">
        <svg class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-5 text-text/40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 15.75l5.159-5.159a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l5.159 5.159m-1.5-1.5l1.409-1.409a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l2.909 2.909m-18 3.75h16.5a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5V6a1.5 1.5 0 00-1.5-1.5H3.75A1.5 1.5 0 002.25 6v12a1.5 1.5 0 001.5 1.5zm10.5-11.25h.008v.008h-.008V8.25zm.375 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0z"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.32em] text-text/60 font-bold">PHOTO COMING SOON</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-8 z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-text/15 via-text/5 to-transparent">
      <div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.32em] text-accent font-bold mb-3">RECENT WORK</div>
      <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em] mb-1 text-text">최신 시공 사례</div>
      <div class="text-[13px] text-text/65">곧 업데이트됩니다</div>
    </div>

    <span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -bottom-20 -right-8 text-[480px] font-black tracking-[-0.06em] leading-[0.8] pointer-events-none" style="color: rgba(31,26,20,0.08);">01</span>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 md:gap-12 px-6 md:px-12 py-7 border-t border-b border-border text-[12px] md:text-[13px] text-muted tracking-[0.22em] font-semibold">
  <span>1일 양생</span>
  <span class="text-accent">●</span>
  <span>커스텀 색상</span>
  <span class="text-accent">●</span>
  <span>규사 입자 선택</span>
  <span class="text-accent">●</span>
  <span>여름 6시간</span>
  <span class="text-accent">●</span>
  <span>겨울 12시간</span>
